# Test file layout

| Kind | Path | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Unit test | `test/unit/**/<Name>.test.ts` | `test/unit/components/SignIn.test.ts` |
| Integration test | `test/integration/**/<name>.test.ts` | `test/integration/api/session/route.test.ts` |
| E2e spec | `test/e2e/<name>.spec.ts` | `test/e2e/sign-in.spec.ts` |
| Page class | `test/e2e/pages/<screen>-page.ts` | `test/e2e/pages/sign-in-page.ts` |
| E2e plan | `test/e2e/plan/<name>.plan.md` | `test/e2e/plan/sign-in.plan.md` |
| E2e seed | `test/e2e/seed.spec.ts` | `test/e2e/seed.spec.ts` |
| Mobile flow | `test/mobile/<feature>/<nn>-<scenario>.flow.yaml` | `test/mobile/sign-in/01-valid-account.flow.yaml` |
| Mobile plan | `test/mobile/plan/<feature>.plan.md` | `test/mobile/plan/sign-in.plan.md` |
| Mobile element file, one for each screen and platform | `test/mobile/elements/<platform>/<screen>.js` | `test/mobile/elements/android/sign-in.js` |
| Mobile element loader | `test/mobile/elements/load.yaml` | `test/mobile/elements/load.yaml` |
| Mobile subflow | `test/mobile/subflows/<name>.yaml` | `test/mobile/subflows/open-sign-in.yaml` |
| Mobile suite file, optional | `test/mobile/config.yaml` | `test/mobile/config.yaml` |

A page class holds one field for each element and one `goto` method, nothing else.

A unit or integration test mirrors the source path. Drop a leading `src/` or `app/` (the first folder only).

| Source file | Test file |
| --- | --- |
| `src/components/SignIn.tsx` | `test/unit/components/SignIn.test.ts` |
| `app/api/session/route.ts` | `test/integration/api/session/route.test.ts` |
| `lib/validation.ts` | `test/unit/lib/validation.test.ts` |

Never create a `.tsx` test file or a `tests/`, `specs/`, or `__tests__/` folder.
